Task 8: Ensemble Learning - Random Forest vs XGBoost

Models Compared:
 Logistic Regression (baseline)
 Random Forest Classifier
 XGBoost Classifier
Performance Table:

| Model                 | Accuracy | Precision | Recall | F1-Score |
|-----------------------|----------|-----------|--------|----------|
| Logistic Regression  | 0.8020   | 0.7900    | 0.7800 | 0.7800   |
| Random Forest        | 0.8210   | 0.8200    | 0.8000 | 0.8100   |
| XGBoost              | 0.8330   | 0.8300    | 0.8100 | 0.8200   |

Key Insight: XGBoost outperformed both models, confirming that boosting (sequential error correction) captures more complex patterns than bagging or linear models.

Feature Importance: Both ensembles identified `tenure`, `MonthlyCharges`, and `Contract` as the top churn drivers.
